utline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-mlbb-gold focus-visible:ring-offset-1 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-2">See all<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-2.5 h-2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></button></div><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:gap-5 xl:flex-col xl:items-start xl:gap-0"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 md:gap-2.5 mb-3 md:mb-0 xl:mb-3 flex-shrink-0 xl:gap-1.5"><span class="contents"><div class="relative w-11 h-11 md:w-12 md:h-12 xl:w-10 xl:h-10 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full flex items-center justify-center" style="background-color:rgba(0,170,255,0.08);border:1.5px solid rgba(0,170,255,0.40);box-shadow:0 0 12px #00AAFF25, inset 0 0 0 1px #00AAFF30"><img alt="Step 1" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png&amp;w=48&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 1x, https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 2x" src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we"/></div></span><span class="contents"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-4 md:w-5 xl:w-3.5 text-base font-heading font-bold leading-none select-none" style="color:#00AAFF;text-shadow:0 0 6px #00AAFF80" aria-hidden="true">➔</span><div class="relative w-11 h-11 md:w-12 md:h-12 xl:w-10 xl:h-10 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full flex items-center justify-center" style="background-color:rgba(0,170,255,0.08);border:1.5px solid rgba(0,170,255,0.40);box-shadow:0 0 12px #00AAFF25, inset 0 0 0 1px #00AAFF30"><img alt="Step 2" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_4d923b809f919ef60ae354ec162cc853.png&amp;w=48&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 1x, https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_4d923b809f919ef60ae354ec162cc853.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 2x" src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_4d923b809f919ef60ae354ec162cc853.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we"/></div></span><span class="contents"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-4 md:w-5 xl:w-3.5 text-base font-heading font-bold leading-none select-none" style="color:#00AAFF;text-shadow:0 0 6px #00AAFF80" aria-hidden="true">➔</span><div class="relative w-11 h-11 md:w-12 md:h-12 xl:w-10 xl:h-10 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full flex items-center justify-center" style="background-color:rgba(0,170,255,0.08);border:1.5px solid rgba(0,170,255,0.40);box-shadow:0 0 12px #00AAFF25, inset 0 0 0 1px #00AAFF30"><img alt="Step 3" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png&amp;w=48&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 1x, https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 2x" src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we"/></div></span></div><p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed md:flex-1">In the laning phase, move around to fill up Khaleed&#x27;s Desert Power first, then hit the opponent with the enhanced Basic Attack to slow them and follow up with 3 hits from his 1st Skill. This should fill up his Desert Power again, allowing for another enhanced Basic Attack.</p></div></div></section></div></div><div class="grid gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2 items-start mb-4 md:mb-6"><div class="hero-overview relative lg:pl-4 lg:border-l lg:border-[#C8AA6E]/30"><span class="hidden lg:block absolute left-0 top-0 w-1 h-12 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F0D060] via-[#C8AA6E] to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed text-sm lg:text-[15px]">Khaleed is sold in the hero pool as an EXP fighter, but the version that actually wins games in 2026 is a roamer carrying Thunder Belt. The Desert Power passive plus a Thunder Belt proc is the single cleanest true-damage tick a non-jungler can produce, and his ultimate is the longest CC-immune forced engage in the roam pool.</p></div><section class="dossier-card relative bg-surface-2/85 backdrop-blur-sm border border-border-default overflow-hidden" style="box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.03) inset, 0 18px 38px -22px rgba(0,0,0,0.85)" aria-label="Hero at-a-glance stats and attributes"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-mlbb-gold/0 via-mlbb-gold-bright/60 to-mlbb-gold/0" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-mlbb-gold-bright/55" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-mlbb-gold-bright/55" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-mlbb-gold/30" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-mlbb-gold/30" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative p-4 md:p-5"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 bg-mlbb-green/10 border border-mlbb-green/40" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-activity w-3 h-3 text-mlbb-green" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2"></path></svg></span><p class="text-[11px] font-heading font-bold text-text-accent uppercase tracking-[0.32em]">At a Glance</p></div><div class="grid gap-2.5 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-x-8 sm:gap-y-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-[10px] md:text-[11px] text-text-muted font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.14em] w-[72px] md:w-20 flex-shrink-0 font-semibold">Durability</span><div class="relative flex-1 h-2.5 overflow-hidden" style="background:#060913;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(200,170,110,0.12), inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.45)"><div class="h-full relative" style="width:80%;background:linear-gradient(90deg, #3498DB80 0%, #3498DB 55%, #3498DB 100%);box-shadow:0 0 8px #3498DBaa, inset 0 0 8px #3498DB40"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image:linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 40%, rgba(255,255,255,0.22) 50%, transparent 60%);mix-blend-mode:overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="background:repeating-linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0, transparent calc(10% - 1px), rgba(0,0,0,0.85) calc(10% - 1px), rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 10%)" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><span class="text-[12px] md:text-[13px] font-heading font-bold tabular-nums w-6 text-right leading-none" style="color:#3498DB;text-shadow:0 0 8px #3498DB50">80</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-[10px] md:text-[11px] text-text-muted font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.14em] w-[72px] md:w-20 flex-shrink-0 font-semibold">Offense</span><div class="relative flex-1 h-2.5 overflow-hidden" style="background:#060913;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(200,170,110,0.12), inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.45)"><div class="h-full relative" style="width:50%;background:linear-gradient(90deg, #E74C3C80 0%, #E74C3C 55%, #E74C3C 100%);box-shadow:0 0 8px #E74C3Caa, inset 0 0 8px #E74C3C40"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image:linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 40%, rgba(255,255,255,0.22) 50%, transparent 60%);mix-blend-mode:overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="background:repeating-linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0, transparent calc(10% - 1px), rgba(0,0,0,0.85) calc(10% - 1px), rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 10%)" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><span class="text-[12px] md:text-[13px] font-heading font-bold tabular-nums w-6 text-right leading-none" style="color:#E74C3C;text-shadow:0 0 8px #E74C3C50">50</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-[10px] md:text-[11px] text-text-muted font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.14em] w-[72px] md:w-20 flex-shrink-0 font-semibold">Control</span><div class="relative flex-1 h-2.5 overflow-hidden" style="background:#060913;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(200,170,110,0.12), inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.45)"><div class="h-full relative" style="width:50%;background:linear-gradient(90deg, #F0D06080 0%, #F0D060 55%, #F0D060 100%);box-shadow:0 0 8px #F0D060aa, inset 0 0 8px #F0D06040"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image:linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 40%, rgba(255,255,255,0.22) 50%, transparent 60%);mix-blend-mode:overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="background:repeating-linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0, transparent calc(10% - 1px), rgba(0,0,0,0.85) calc(10% - 1px), rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 10%)" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><span class="text-[12px] md:text-[13px] font-heading font-bold tabular-nums w-6 text-right leading-none" style="color:#F0D060;text-shadow:0 0 8px #F0D06050">50</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-[10px] md:text-[11px] text-text-muted font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.14em] w-[72px] md:w-20 flex-shrink-0 font-semibold">Difficulty</span><div class="relative flex-1 h-2.5 overflow-hidden" style="background:#060913;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(200,170,110,0.12), inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.45)"><div class="h-full relative" style="width:50%;background:linear-gradient(90deg, #9B59B680 0%, #9B59B6 55%, #9B59B6 100%);box-shadow:0 0 8px #9B59B6aa, inset 0 0 8px #9B59B640"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image:linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 40%, rgba(255,255,255,0.22) 50%, transparent 60%);mix-blend-mode:overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="background:repeating-linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0, transparent calc(10% - 1px), rgba(0,0,0,0.85) calc(10% - 1px), rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 10%)" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><span class="text-[12px] md:text-[13px] font-heading font-bold tabular-nums w-6 text-right leading-none" style="color:#9B59B6;text-shadow:0 0 8px #9B59B650">50</span></div></div><a class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-text-accent hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors" href="/tier-list">See Khaleed in full tier list<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3 h-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></section></div><div id="ad-4865714798" class="my-6" style="width:100%"><style>#ad-4865714798{min-height:280px}@media(min-width:768px){#ad-4865714798{min-height:280px}}</style><p class="text-[10px] font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#9BA0B4]/40 text-center mb-2">Advertisement</p><ins class="adsbygoogle" style="display:block" data-ad-client="ca-pub-3465999061396690" data-ad-slot="4865714798" data-ad-format="auto" data-full-width-responsive="true"></ins></div><div class="relative content-lazy lg:grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_clamp(230px,24%,300px)] lg:gap-x-6 xl:gap-x-8 lg:items-start"><div class="lg:order-2 lg:sticky lg:self-start" style="top:128px"></div><section id="hero-article" class="relative lg:order-1 bg-[#0a0a0a]/85 backdrop-blur-sm border border-[#C8AA6E]/15 p-5 md:p-9 overflow-hidden" style="box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.03) inset, 0 18px 38px -24px rgba(0,0,0,0.8)"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#F0D060]/55 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-[#F0D060]/40" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-[#C8AA6E]/30" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-[#C8AA6E]/30" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-[#C8AA6E]/30" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute -top-32 -right-24 w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-[#C8AA6E]/[0.05] blur-3xl pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative hero-article-body max-w-[860px] mx-auto"><h2 class="text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative"><span aria-hidden="true" class="block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3"></span>Is Khaleed the right roamer for this draft?</h2>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Lock Khaleed when your team already has two damage threats and needs an initiator who can walk the long route between lanes without buying a mana item. He wins the draft against squishy-mage comps (Marcel, Silvanna, Ling, Hanzo) where his ult lands straight on the backline and the enhanced basic slow pins them before they can escape. His S2 self-heal plus damage reduction means he trades well in pure melee scuffles where no one has a hard displacement.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Avoid him when the enemy has Phoveus, Khufra, or Chou. Phoveus&#x27;s revamped kit punishes exactly what Khaleed does: his ultimate is CD-free and leaps onto any hero he marks with Dark Wave, and Astaros&#x27; Gaze trims his cooldowns every time you dash near him, so the Raging Sandstorm charge feeds Phoveus&#x27;s rotation instead of opening the fight. Khufra&#x27;s S2 ball can cancel the ult at the landing and wastes Khaleed&#x27;s only hard gap-closer for a full rotation. Chou out-mobilities him in both directions and punishes an over-extended engage with a displaced ult.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">If your draft has no tank and you are considering Khaleed to fill the slot, he is the wrong answer. Khaleed peaks around 20 minutes and falls off into Yu Zhong, Uranus, and Esmeralda in the 25+ window. If you cannot name a primary damage carry who is scaling past him, someone else should be rotating.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Patch 2.1.88 (<a class="text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors" href="/patch-notes">patch notes</a>) trimmed his early Desert Tornado burst and shortened his Quicksand Guard cooldown. That only sharpens the read: play him as a durable engage roamer who survives the first exchange and re-commits, not as a damage threat who deletes a backline.</p>
<h2 class="text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative"><span aria-hidden="true" class="block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3"></span>The one thing that makes Khaleed work</h2>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Khaleed is not a fighter. He is a mobile CC platform whose basic attacks true-damage-proc defense items.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Sand Walk charges while he is moving, not while he is fighting, which is why he is a roamer and not a laner. A roamer walks more than a laner in the first ten minutes, and every step charges the next enhanced basic. That enhanced basic lands a heavy slow on the target, which is enough time to land all three casts of Desert Tornado on them and long enough for a Thunder Belt proc to add true damage in the same window. Nothing else in the kit makes sense without this loop. S2 exists to survive the part of the fight before the loop resets. The ult exists to start the loop on a target who is not standing next to him yet.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">The tell for a good Khaleed is whether he arrives at the fight with Desert Power already charged. If he crosses the river with no orange ring under his feet, he is playing the kit wrong.</p>
<h2 class="text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative"><span aria-hidden="true" class="block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3"></span>Laning: the first six minutes</h2>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Khaleed is a roamer. He visits lanes; he does not own one. The opening rotation is the game.</p>
<ol class="list-decimal list-inside text-[#9BA0B4] my-3 space-y-2 ml-2">
<li class="text-[#9BA0B4]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Take S1 at level 1 and start at the buff your jungler does not want.</strong> Usually that means starting red if your jungler takes blue, then rotating to river before minions clash. Desert Power charges during the walk, so by the time you arrive at mid, your enhanced basic is ready for the first harass window.</li>
<li class="text-[#9BA0B4]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">First gank target is the squishy mid mage.</strong> Ult at an angle so the knockback pushes them into your mid laner, not into their own tower. If you ult straight down-lane, you hand them free tower range. If you ult from the side, the stun lands in kill range.</li>
<li class="text-[#9BA0B4]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Never cast S2 before you are already committed.</strong> Quicksand Guard is a Focused Cast, which means any CC interrupts it and you eat the full combo with no heal and no damage reduction. Use it after the fight has started and the enemy has blown their first hard lock, not as a pre-emptive shield.</li>
</ol>
<h2 class="text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative"><span aria-hidden="true" class="block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3"></span>The power spike you are farming toward</h2>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Thunder Belt plus a boot upgrade. That is the whole conversation.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]"><a class="text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors" href="/items/thunder-belt">Thunder Belt</a> turns a periodic basic attack into a true-damage tick that scales with your defensive stats instead of your attack, and staples a near-total slow onto the target for a beat. Because the proc reads your physical and magic defense, every tank item you buy quietly raises that tick. Khaleed&#x27;s enhanced basic already carries its own slow, and Desert Power recharges fast enough during rotations that the enhanced basic comes back every few seconds of walking. Land the two on the same swing and a squishy is frozen in place long enough for your team&#x27;s follow-up to connect.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Before Thunder Belt the hero ganks. After Thunder Belt the hero executes. That is the line. The spike lands around the 9 to 12 minute mark depending on rotation farm, and it is the point where Khaleed stops being a nuisance and starts being the reason a fight opens.</p>
<h2 class="text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative"><span aria-hidden="true" class="block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3"></span>Teamfight positioning and target priority</h2>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">The reflex when you play a mana-less fighter with a big ult is to charge first and ask questions later. On Khaleed that reflex gets your team aced.</p>
<ol class="list-decimal list-inside text-[#9BA0B4] my-3 space-y-2 ml-2">
<li class="text-[#9BA0B4]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Ult last, not first.</strong> Raging Sandstorm is CC-immune during the charge but it is loud and slow, which means any tank with a ready engage tool (Khufra ball, Atlas ult, Tigreal hook) will catch you the instant you land. Let your primary tank burn the enemy&#x27;s hard CC first, then ult into the backline while their lock is on cooldown.</li>
<li class="text-[#9BA0B4]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Angle the ult to knock them toward your team, not through it.</strong> The knockback path runs from Khaleed&#x27;s start position to the destination. If you ult from behind the enemy carry, they get shoved further from your team and toward their own support. Ult from the side or from your team&#x27;s flank so the displacement lands them inside your damage.</li>
<li class="text-[#9BA0B4]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">S1 is a commit, not an escape.</strong> Desert Tornado is an AoE whirl that pulls enemies in and lets you reposition a step between each of its three casts. It is sticking power, not a getaway: it barely moves you and it dodges nothing. Cast it when you already have a target pinned, not as a panic button when you are the one caught out.</li>
</ol>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Edge case: if your support is Angela or Faramis, you can ult further forward than usual because Angela&#x27;s shield follows you through the charge and Faramis can rez the greed. If your second frontliner is Johnson or Franco, stay conservative; both of them expect the initiator to survive their own engage.</p><div id="ad-7246933188" class="my-8" style="width:100%"><style>#ad-7246933188{min-height:280px}@media(min-width:768px){#ad-7246933188{min-height:320px}}</style><p class="text-[10px] font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#9BA0B4]/40 text-center mb-2">Advertisement</p><ins class="adsbygoogle" style="display:block;text-align:center" data-ad-client="ca-pub-3465999061396690" data-ad-slot="7246933188" data-ad-format="fluid" data-ad-layout="in-article"></ins></div><h2 class="text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative"><span aria-hidden="true" class="block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3"></span>Itemization: defaults vs flex slots</h2>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">Two slots are locked, four are real conversations.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Locked</strong>: Warrior Boots or Tough Boots (read the enemy comp, not the guide) and Thunder Belt. Go Tough Boots if the enemy has two CC threats or two burst mages; the 30% slow and CC duration reduction is worth more than 18 physical defense in every roam fight.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Flex slot 1 is anti-heal when the enemy has Estes, Esmeralda, Alice, or Yu Zhong.</strong> <a class="text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors" href="/items/dominance-ice">Dominance Ice</a> is the right pick over <a class="text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors" href="/items/sea-halberd">Sea Halberd</a> for this build: its Lifebane cuts the shield and HP regen of every enemy within 5 units to 60% of normal, which is always ticking in a melee where your whole job is to stand in the middle of the fight, and its 40 physical defense plus 5% movement speed feed the Thunder Belt proc and Desert Power rotations. Sea Halberd&#x27;s cut lasts three seconds on your target, but the attack stats on it fight the defense-scaling thesis of this build.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Flex slot 2 is defense scaling</strong>. Against a physical-heavy enemy take <a class="text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors" href="/items/antique-cuirass">Antique Cuirass</a> for the stacking damage reduction against skill users. Against a mage-heavy enemy take <a class="text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors" href="/items/athenas-shield">Athena&#x27;s Shield</a> for the 25% magic damage reduction on hit. Do not take both; the second defensive item should be situational, not symmetric.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Flex slot 3 is utility</strong>. <a class="text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors" href="/items/oracle">Oracle</a> is underrated on Khaleed specifically because its Bless passive increases received shield and HP regen effects by 25%, which makes the S2 heal roughly a quarter bigger during the focused cast. Alternatively, <a class="text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors" href="/items/queens-wings">Queen&#x27;s Wings</a> if you are the primary engage and dying first; the 30% damage reduction under 40% HP plus the 2-second cooldown refund means you get S2 back faster when it matters.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Flex slot 4 is closer</strong>. <a class="text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors" href="/items/immortality">Immortality</a> is the default if the fights are lasting past 6 seconds. If the enemy has two burst assassins who erase you the moment the revive lands, skip Immortality entirely and take <a class="text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors" href="/items/guardian-helmet">Guardian Helmet</a> for the 2.5% max HP regen that lets you pressure lanes without base trips.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]">The weakest common buy is <a class="text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors" href="/items/blade-armor">Blade Armor</a>. Every guide recommends it against auto-attackers but Khaleed has no way to force them to basic him; his S2 pulses quicksand, not a taunt, and his ult is a displacement that moves enemies away from him. Blade Armor punishes stationary trades Khaleed is not built to hold.</p>
<h2 class="text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative"><span aria-hidden="true" class="block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3"></span>Mistakes that lose Khaleed games</h2>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Casting S2 before the enemy burns their hard CC.</strong> Quicksand Guard is a Focused Cast. Any stun, knockup, silence, or displacement cancels it and refunds nothing. Players instinctively press S2 when their HP drops below 60% because they see the shield icon in their head, but if the enemy has not used their lock yet, the cast gets interrupted, you lose the heal, and the self-slow from the quicksand pool keeps you pinned. Correct order: eat the first CC, survive it with your HP bar and Thunder Belt&#x27;s defense stats, then S2 during the 3-second window before their cooldowns come back.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Ulting into Khufra ball.</strong> Raging Sandstorm is CC-immune during the charge, not at the destination. The instant Khaleed reaches the end of the dash, his CC immunity ends and the stun he applies to enemies can also be applied to him. Khufra timing her S2 to intercept the landing is a free cancel every time. Against Khufra, save the ult until her S2 is on cooldown, or use it as a disengage out of her engage rather than into her.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Expecting S1 to close the gap.</strong> Desert Tornado pulls enemies into you and lets you shuffle a step between casts, but it is not a dash and it will not chase a target who is already running. Khaleed&#x27;s only real gap-closers are the Sand Walk glide and the ult charge. If you walk into a gank expecting the whirl to catch a fleeing squishy, you whiff the combo and hand them the kill. Arrive already on top of the target with Desert Power charged, or do not commit at all.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Buying damage items on a roam build.</strong> Corrosion Scythe, Blade of Despair, and Haas&#x27;s Claws all look tempting because the enhanced basic does physical damage that scales with total physical attack. They are traps on a roamer because Khaleed does not have enough farm priority to reach the two-item spike before 18 minutes, and a physical-damage Khaleed with no defense stats gets deleted by any assassin who walks to the side lane. Thunder Belt plus tank items does more damage in a real fight because the Thunder Belt proc scales with the defense stats you are already buying.</p>
<p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]"><strong class="text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold">Rotating without Desert Power charged.</strong> Arriving at a gank with the orange ring still filling means the first enhanced basic is 2 to 3 seconds away, which is exactly long enough for the squishy target to Flicker out. Take the long path between lanes instead of the direct one. Walk the river bushes on the way to mid rather than cutting through tri-bush. The few extra seconds of movement are what makes the gank lethal.</p>
<h2 class="text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative"><span aria-hidden="true" class="block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3"></span>Key tips</h2>
<div class="my-5 p-4 flex gap-3" style="background:rgba(200,170,110,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(200,170,110,0.35)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lightbulb w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#C8AA6E"><path d="M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5"></path><path d="M9 18h6"></path><path d="M10 22h4"></path></svg><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p class="text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1" style="color:#C8AA6E">Tip</p><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Thunder Belt&#x27;s true-damage proc ignores armor, magic resistance, and damage reduction. That is why it works against Uranus and Yu Zhong specifically: both stack defense stats that blunt physical damage, but the Thunder Belt tick scales with your defense, not theirs, so it does not care how tanky they are.</p></div></div>
<div class="my-5 p-4 flex gap-3" style="background:rgba(0,170,255,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(0,170,255,0.35)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#00AAFF"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p class="text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1" style="color:#00AAFF">Note</p><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">The Desert Power ring is visible to enemies. Good mages will intentionally trade a spell to force you to burn your enhanced basic before the gank lands. Against Pharsa, Valentina, or Kagura specifically, pre-charge out of vision and enter the lane already loaded rather than walking in neutrally.</p></div></div>
<div class="my-5 p-4 flex gap-3" style="background:rgba(200,170,110,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(200,170,110,0.35)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lightbulb w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#C8AA6E"><path d="M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5"></path><path d="M9 18h6"></path><path d="M10 22h4"></path></svg><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p class="text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1" style="color:#C8AA6E">Tip</p><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Desert Tornado lets you reposition between its three casts, and that reposition is the whole skill ceiling. As enemies scatter out of the first whirl, drift toward the carry trying to walk out so the second and third casts re-center the pull on them, instead of re-hitting the frontliner you already caught.</p></div></div>
<div class="my-5 p-4 flex gap-3" style="background:rgba(0,170,255,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(0,170,255,0.35)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#00AAFF"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p class="text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1" style="color:#00AAFF">Note</p><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Against Phoveus, your movement is his fuel. The revamped kit no longer resets his ultimate off enemy dashes: Infernal Pursuit is CD-free and leaps onto any hero he marks with Dark Wave, and Astaros&#x27; Gaze trims his cooldowns every time you dash, blink, or get displaced within 8 units. Treat it as a distance problem, not an ult-restraint problem: keep the Sand Walk glide outside that radius, and never commit the Raging Sandstorm charge while a Dark Wave mark is already on you, because the leap is coming either way.</p></div></div>
<div class="my-5 p-4 flex gap-3" style="background:rgba(200,170,110,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(200,170,110,0.35)"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lightbulb w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true" style="color:#C8AA6E"><path d="M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5"></path><path d="M9 18h6"></path><path d="M10 22h4"></path></svg><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p class="text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1" style="color:#C8AA6E">Tip</p><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Take <a class="text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors" href="/spells">Flicker</a> over <a class="text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors" href="/spells">Sprint</a> even though the hero has built-in mobility. Sprint wastes a slot on a hero who already gets a movement-speed surge from Sand Walk and a long ult charge. Flicker after landing the ult is how you reposition for the cleanup: the ult&#x27;s destination is exactly where the enemy wants to kite you from, and a Flicker onto the stunned target closes the last stretch before their team arrives.</p></div></div><aside class="not-prose mt-10 border border-mlbb-gold/25 bg-mlbb-bg-accent/30 p-5 sm:p-6" aria-label="About the author of this Khaleed guide"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-5"><a class="shrink-0" aria-label="About Slendertaker" href="/authors/slendertaker"><img alt="Slendertaker" loading="lazy" width="72" height="72" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-[72px] w-[72px] rounded-full border border-mlbb-gold/50 object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="/authors/slendertaker.webp"/></a><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-mlbb-text-secondary">Written by</div><a class="font-heading text-lg text-mlbb-gold hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" rel="author" href="/authors/slendertaker">Slendertaker</a><div class="text-sm text-mlbb-text-secondary">Mythic Immortal, Founder &amp; Editor of MLBBHub</div><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-mlbb-text">Slendertaker climbed to Mythic Immortal in Mobile Legends, the apex of the ranked ladder, before sitting down to build the tool he wished existed while he was getting there. MLBBHub is that tool. He writes every hero guide on the site personally, picks the curated builds, and owns the data pipeline that keeps patch notes, items, and emblems in sync.</p><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a href="https://github.com/slendertaker" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer me" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-mlbb-gold/30 bg-mlbb-bg-accent/40 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-mlbb-text-secondary transition hover:border-mlbb-gold hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" aria-label="GitHub profile"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-github" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4"></path><path d="M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2"></path></svg><span>GitHub</span></a><a href="https://x.com/slendertaker7" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer me" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-mlbb-gold/30 bg-mlbb-bg-accent/40 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-mlbb-text-secondary transition hover:border-mlbb-gold hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" aria-label="X profile"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-twitter" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 4s-.7 2.1-2 3.4c1.6 10-9.4 17.3-18 11.6 2.2.1 4.4-.6 6-2C3 15.5.5 9.6 3 5c2.2 2.6 5.6 4.1 9 4-.9-4.2 4-6.6 7-3.8 1.1 0 3-1.2 3-1.2z"></path></svg><span>X</span></a><a href="https://slendertaker.com" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer me" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-mlbb-gold/30 bg-mlbb-bg-accent/40 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-mlbb-text-secondary transition hover:border-mlbb-gold hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" aria-label="slendertaker.com profile"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg><span>slendertaker.com</span></a></div></div></div></aside></div></section></div></div><div id="tabpanel-skills" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-skills" hidden=""></div><div id="tabpanel-matchups" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-matchups" tabindex="0" hidden=""><div class="space-y-6 lg:space-y-8"><div class="glass-card border-mlbb-gold/15 p-4 sm:p-5" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(-8px)"><div class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)_auto] items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-4 lg:grid-cols-[auto_auto_minmax(0,1fr)_auto] lg:gap-x-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 bg-mlbb-red/10 border border-mlbb-red/30 flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield w-5 h-5 text-mlbb-red" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg></div><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-xs font-heading font-bold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-wider">Top Counter</p><p class="flex min-w-0 flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-1.5 text-sm text-text-accent-bright font-heading font-bold"><span class="min-w-0 truncate">Fredrinn</span><span class="shrink-0 text-mlbb-green text-xs">+<!-- -->2.9<!-- --> pp</span></p></div><a aria-label="Open full counter page for Khaleed" class="group inline-flex h-8 items-center justify-center gap-1.5 border border-mlbb-gold/20 bg-surface-2/45 px-2.5 font-heading text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-text-accent transition-colors hover:border-mlbb-gold-bright/45 hover:text-text-accent-bright lg:col-start-4 lg:row-start-1" href="/counter/khaleed"><span>View all</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><div class="col-span-3 grid gap-2 text-center grid-cols-3 sm:flex sm:items-center sm:justify-around lg:col-span-1 lg:col-start-3 lg:row-start-1"><div><p class="text-lg font-heading font-bold text-mlbb-green">5</p><p class="text-[9px] text-text-muted uppercase tracking-wider">Counters</p></div><div><p class="text-lg font-heading font-bold text-text-accent">8</p><p class="text-[9px] text-text-muted uppercase tracking-wider">Weak To</p></div><div><p class="text-lg font-heading font-bold text-text-accent-bright truncate">Balanced</p><p class="text-[9px] text-text-muted uppercase tracking-wider">Peak Phase</p></div></div></div></div><div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start lg:gap-6"><section><div class="mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield w-5 h-5 text-mlbb-green" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg><h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-heading font-bold text-text-primary">How to Counter<!-- --> <span style="color:#ff4444">Khaleed</span></h2></div><p class="text-xs text-text-muted max-w-2xl">These heroes have the biggest measured edge against Khaleed in ranked matches. Pick any of them for a statistical advantage in draft.</p></div><div class="space-y-3"><div class="group relative bg-surface-3 border border-mlbb-gold/15 hover:border-mlbb-green/30 transition-all duration-300" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 sm:gap-4 sm:p-4"><div class="flex-shrink-0 w-7 sm:w-8 text-center"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-heading font-bold text-text-accent">#<!-- -->1</span></div><a class="flex-shrink-0" href="/heroes/fredrinn"><div class="relative overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 rounded-full" style="width:48px;height:48px;min-width:48px;background-color:#FF8C0012"><img alt="Fredrinn hero icon" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-full w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_dea170bfd5f26c41fb04e5edf72afedb.png&amp;w=48&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 1x, https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_dea170bfd5f26c41fb04e5edf72afedb.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 2x" src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_dea170bfd5f26c41fb04e5edf72afedb.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we"/></div></a><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 flex-wrap"><a class="min-w-0 max-w-full truncate font-heading font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-text-primary hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors" href="/heroes/fredrinn">Fredrinn</a><div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center font-heading font-bold bg-gradient-to-br from-[#00AAFF] to-[#0077CC] text-[#00111a] shadow-[0_0_12px_rgba(0,170,255,0.3)] w-6 h-6 text-xs animate-tier-pop">B</div><div class="gap-1.5 hidden sm:flex"><span class="text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5" style="background-color:#FF8C0020;color:#ffaf4d">Fighter</span><span class="text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5" style="background-color:#3498DB20;color:#71b7e6">Tank</span></div></div><p class="text-xs text-text-muted mt-1 line-clamp-2">Fredrinn&#x27;s durability and kit give them a strong matchup advantage against Khaleed throughout the game.</p></div><div class="flex-shrink-0 text-right"><p class="flex items-center justify-end gap-1 text-lg sm:text-xl font-heading font-bold" style="color:#44ff88"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 7h6v6"></path><path d="m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17"></path></svg>+<!-- -->2.9</p><p class="text-[9px] text-text-muted uppercase hidden sm:block">win rate delta</p></div></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-mlbb-gold/20 pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-mlbb-gold/20 pointer-events-none"></div></div><div class="group relative bg-surface-3 border border-mlbb-gold/15 hover:border-mlbb-green/30 transition-all duration-300" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 sm:gap-4 sm:p-4"><div class="flex-shrink-0 w-7 sm:w-8 text-center"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-heading font-bold text-text-accent">#<!-- -->2</span></div><a class="flex-shrink-0" href="/heroes/phoveus"><div class="relative overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 rounded-full" style="width:48px;height:48px;min-width:48px;background-color:#FF8C0012"><img alt="Phoveus hero icon" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-full w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_af21c0dd8b5308c27974bff900803a9a.png&amp;w=48&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 1x, https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_af21c0dd8b5308c27974bff900803a9a.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 2x" src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_af21c0dd8b5308c27974bff900803a9a.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we"/></div></a><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3 flex-wrap"><a class="min-w-0 max-w-full truncate font-heading font-bold text-base sm:text-lg text-text-primary hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors" href="/heroes/phoveus">Phoveus</a><div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center font-heading font-bold bg-gradient-to-br from-[#9BA0B4] to-[#606478] text-[#101012] w-6 h-6 text-xs animate-tier-pop">C</div><div class="gap-1.5 hidden sm:flex"><span class="text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5" style="background-color:#FF8C0020;color:#ffaf4d">Fighter</span></div></div><p class="text-xs text-text-muted mt-1 line-clamp-2">Phoveus&#x27;s durability and kit give them a strong matchup advantage against Khaleed throughout the game.</p></div><div class="flex-shrink-0 text-right"><p class="flex items-center justify-end gap-1 text-lg sm:text-xl font-heading font-bold" style="color:#44ff88"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up w-3.5 h-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 7h6v6"></path><path d="m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17"></path></svg>+<!-- -->2.8</p><p class="text-[9px] text-text-muted uppercase hidden sm:block">win rate delta</p></div></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-mlbb-gold/20 pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-mlbb-gold/20 pointer-events-none"></div></div><div class="group relative bg-surface-3 border border-mlbb-gold/15 hover:border-mlbb-green/30 transition-all duration-300" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 sm:gap-4 sm:p-4"><div class="flex-shrink-0 w-7 sm:w-8 text-center"><span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-heading font-bold text-text-accent">#<!-- -->3</span></div><a class="flex-shrink-0" href="/heroes/joy"><div class="relative overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 rounded-full" style="width:48px;height:48px;min-width:48px;background-color:#00AAFF12"><img alt="Joy hero icon" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-full w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_d3a3a55c22000ae78732fed8cba2efef.png&amp;w=48&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 1x, https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_d3a3a55c22000ae78732fed8cba2efef.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 2x" src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngj