tpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/khaleed/Hero982-portrait-20220525170301.webp\",\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/khaleed/Khaleed-Prince-of-Sand-20240403054104.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Khaleed/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Crescent Scimitar\",\"tier\":\"Common\",\"rawTier\":\"Common\",\"tag\":\"Elite\",\"tagSlug\":\"elite\",\"price\":\"Limited-time Event\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero983-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/khaleed/Hero983-portrait-20220525170302.webp\",\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/khaleed/Khaleed-Crescent-Scimitar-20260323041026.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Khaleed/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Wave Strider\",\"tier\":\"Deluxe\",\"rawTier\":\"Deluxe\",\"tag\":\"Epic\",\"tagSlug\":\"epic\",\"price\":\"899\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero984-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/khaleed/Hero984-portrait-20240507150206.webp\",\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/khaleed/Khaleed-Wave-Strider-20240507145907.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Khaleed/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Desert Salamander\",\"tier\":\"Common\",\"rawTier\":\"Common\",\"tag\":\"S36\",\"tagSlug\":\"s36\",\"price\":\"Season 36\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero985-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/khaleed/Hero985-portrait-20250307123916.webp\",\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/khaleed/Khaleed-Desert-Salamander-20250301020402.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Khaleed/Cosmetics\"}],\"lore\":{\"backstory\":\"Khaleed is the Desert Prince, a noble warrior from the shifting sands of the Western Desert. He was heir to a great desert kingdom until a sandstorm of magical origin buried his city beneath the dunes. Khaleed survived by bonding with the desert itself, learning to ride sand waves and command desert tornadoes. His sand-walking ability heals him as he traverses his beloved desert, and his Raging Sandstorm can sweep across entire battlefields. Khaleed fights to reclaim his buried kingdom and protect fellow desert dwellers.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"khufra\",\"heroName\":\"Khufra\",\"relationship\":\"Ancient desert king whose tomb he guards\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"esmeralda\",\"heroName\":\"Esmeralda\",\"relationship\":\"Desert oracle and trusted advisor\"}],\"rivals\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"thamuz\",\"heroName\":\"Thamuz\",\"relationship\":\"Lava lord whose heat turns sand to glass\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"baxia\",\"heroName\":\"Baxia\",\"relationship\":\"Eastern guardian whose shell deflects his sand\"}]},\"loreUrlName\":\"Khaleed\",\"statsHistory\":[{\"date\":\"2026-09-07\",\"winRate\":51.01,\"pickRate\":0.14,\"banRate\":0.12},{\"date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"winRate\":50.93,\"pickRate\":0.14,\"banRate\":0.12},{\"date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"winRate\":50.86,\"pickRate\":0.14,\"banRate\":0.12},{\"date\":\"2026-09-28\",\"winRate\":51.1,\"pickRate\":0.12,\"banRate\":0.07},{\"date\":\"2026-10-02\",\"winRate\":50.93,\"pickRate\":0.12,\"banRate\":0.08},{\"date\":\"2026-10-09\",\"winRate\":50.69,\"pickRate\":0.12,\"banRate\":0.08},{\"date\":\"2026-10-17\",\"winRate\":50.79,\"pickRate\":0.12,\"banRate\":0.08}]},\"relatedHeroesSlot\":\"$L66\",\"statsSeoSlot\":\"$L67\",\"fieldManualSlot\":\"$L68\"}]\n61:[\"$\",\"$L69\",null,{\"heroName\":\"Khaleed\",\"heroSlug\":\"khaleed\",\"roles\":\"$60:props:hero:role\",\"lanes\":\"$60:props:hero:lane\",\"difficulty\":2,\"winRate\":50.79,\"pickRate\":0.12,\"banRate\":0.08,\"curatedBuilds\":\"$60:props:curatedBuilds\",\"topCounters\":\"$60:props:tabData:counterData:countersThisHero\",\"hasCounterPage\":true,\"hasRankStats\":true,\"locale\":\"en\",\"pageUrl\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/khaleed\",\"year\":2026}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"6a:I[313915,[\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$b\",\"$2e\",\"$3e\",\"$3f\"],\"d