]]}]]}]\na3:[\"$\",\"article\",\"mythical_glory\",{\"className\":\"group relative min-w-0 border border-mlbb-gold/15 bg-surface-1/40 p-3.5 pl-5 md:p-4 md:pl-6 transition-colors hover:border-mlbb-gold/30\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-[3px]\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"linear-gradient(to bottom, #ff5d73, #ff5d7333)\",\"boxShadow\":\"0 0 12px -2px #ff5d7380\"}}],[\"$\",\"header\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-2 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-x-3 gap-y-1 flex-wrap\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-baseline gap-2.5 text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold text-text-primary uppercase tracking-[0.06em]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-block rounded-sm px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.16em] self-center\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#ff5d73\",\"background\":\"#ff5d731a\",\"border\":\"1px solid #ff5d7340\"},\"children\":\"Mythical Glory+\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankCardH3\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"Khaleed\",\"rank\":\"Mythical Glory+\"}}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"href\":\"/tier-list?rank=mythical_glory\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-text-accent hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankTierListLink\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Mythical Glory+\"}}],\" →\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-muted text-[13px] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceLead\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Mythical Glory+\",\"name\":\"Khaleed\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"47.67\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid1\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"Khaleed\",\"delta\":\"-3.16%\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"0.14\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid2\"}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"0.04\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceAfter\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Mythical Glory+\"}}]]}]]}]\na5:[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-1\",{\"href\":\"/items/queens-wings\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Queen's Wings\"}]\na6:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-5\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Flex slot 4 is closer\"}],\". \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/items/immortality\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Immortality\"}],\" is the default if the fights are lasting past 6 seconds. If the enemy has two burst assassins who erase you the moment the revive lands, skip Immortality entirely and take \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-1\",{\"href\":\"/items/guardian-helmet\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Guardian Helmet\"}],\" for the 2.5% max HP regen that lets you pressure lanes without base trips.\"]}]\na7:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-6\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[\"The weakest common buy is \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/items/blade-armor\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Blade Armor\"}],\". Every guide recommends it against auto-attackers but Khaleed has no way to force them to basic him; his S2 pulses quicksand, not a taunt, and his ult is a displacement that moves enemies away from him. Blade Armor punishes stationary trades Khaleed is not built to hold.\"]}]\na8:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-1\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Mistakes that lose Khaleed games\"]}]\na9:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-7\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Casting S2 before the enemy burns their hard CC.\"}],\" Quicksand Guard is a Focused Cast. Any stun, knockup, silence, or displacement cancels it and refunds nothing. Players instinctively press S2 when their HP drops below 60% because they see the shield icon in their head, but if the enemy has not used their lock yet, the cast gets interrupted, you lose the heal, and the self-slow from the quicksand pool keeps you pinned. Correct order: eat the first CC, survive it with your HP bar and Thunder Belt's defense stats, then S2 during the 3-second window before their cooldowns come back.\"]}]\naa:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-8\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Ulting into Khufra ball.\"}],\" Raging Sandstorm is CC-immune during the charge, not at the destination. The instant Khaleed reaches the end of the dash, his CC immunity ends and the stun he applies to enemies can also be applied to him. Khufra timing her S2 to intercept the landing is a free cancel every time. Against Khufra, save the ult until her S2 is on cooldown, or use it as a disengage out of her engage rather than into her.\"]}]\nab:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-9\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Expecting S1 to close the gap.\"}],\" Desert Tornado pulls enemies into you and lets you shuffle a step between casts, but it is not a dash and it will not chase a target who is already running. Khaleed's only real gap-closers are the Sand Walk glide and the ult charge. If you walk into a gank expecting the whirl to catch a fleeing squishy, you whiff the combo and hand them the kill. Arrive already on top of the target with Desert Power charged, or do not commit at all.\"]}]\nac:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-10\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Buying damage items on a roam build.\"}],\" Corrosion Scythe, Blade of Despair, and Haas's Claws all look tempting because the enhanced basic does physical damage that scales with total physical attack. They are traps on a roamer because Khaleed does not have enough farm priority to reach the two-item spike before 18 minutes, and a physical-damage Khaleed with no defense stats gets deleted by any assassin who walks to the side lane. Thunder Belt plus tank items does more damage in a real fight because the Thunder Belt proc scales with the defense stats you are already buying.\"]}]\nad:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-11\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Rotating without Desert Power charged.\"}],\" Arriving at a gank with the orange ring still filling means the first enhanced basic is 2 to 3 seconds away, which is exactly long enough for the squishy target to Flicker out. Take the long path between lanes instead of the direct one. Walk the river bushes on the way to mid rather than cutting through tri-bush. The few extra seconds of movement are what makes the gank lethal.\"]}]\nae:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-2\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Key tips\"]}]\naf:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-0\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(200,170,110,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(200,170,110,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-lightbulb w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gvzjb\",{\"d\":\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"x1upvd\",{\"d\":\"M9 18h6\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"ceow96\",{\"d\":\"M10 22h4\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":\"Tip\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Thunder Belt's true-damage proc ignores armor, magic resistance, and damage reduction. That is why it works against Uranus and Yu Zhong specifically: both stack defense stats that blunt physical damage, but the Thunder Belt tick scales with your defense, not theirs, so it does not care how tanky they are.\"]}]]]}]]}]\nb0:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-1\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(0,170,255,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(0,170,255,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-info w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"1dtifu\",{\"d\":\"M12 16v-4\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"e9boi3\",{\"d\":\"M12 8h.01\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":\"Note\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"The Desert Power ring is visible to enemies. Good mages will intentionally trade a spell to force you to burn your enhanced basic before the gank lands. Against Pharsa, Valentina, or Kagura specifically, pre-charge out of vision and enter the lane already loaded rather than walking in neutrally.\"]}]]]}]]}]\nb1:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-2\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(200,170,110,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(200,170,110,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-lightbulb w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gvzjb\",{\"d\":\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"x1upvd\",{\"d\":\"M9 18h6\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"ceow96\",{\"d\":\"M10 22h4\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":\"Tip\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Desert Tornado lets you reposition between its three casts, and that reposition is the whole skill ceiling. As enemies scatter out of the first whirl, drift toward the carry trying to walk out so the second and third casts re-center the pull on them, instead of re-hitting the frontliner you already caught.\"]}]]]}]]}]\nb2:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-3\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(0,170,255,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(0,170,255,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-info w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"1dtifu\",{\"d\":\"M12 16v-4\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"e9boi3\",{\"d\":\"M12 8h.01\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":\"Note\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Against Phoveus, your movement is his fuel. The revamped kit no longer resets his ultimate off enemy dashes: Infernal Pursuit is CD-free and leaps onto any hero he marks with Dark Wave, and Astaros' Gaze trims his cooldowns every time you dash, blink, or get displaced within 8 units. Treat it as a distance problem, not an ult-restraint problem: keep the Sand Walk glide outside that radius, and never commit the Raging Sandstorm charge while a Dark Wave mark is already on you, because the leap is coming either way.\"]}]]]}]]}]\nb3:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-4\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(200,170,110,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(200,170,110,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-lightbulb w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gvzjb\",{\"d\":\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"x1upvd\",{\"d\":\"M9 18h6\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"ceow96\",{\"d\":\"M10 22h4\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":\"Tip\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Take \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\".$a-0\",{\"href\":\"/spells\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Flicker\"}],\" over \",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\".$a-1\",{\"href\":\"/spells\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Sprint\"}],\" even though the hero has built-in mobility. Sprint wastes a slot on a hero who already gets a movement-speed surge from Sand Walk and a long ult charge. Flicker after landing the ult is how you reposition for the cleanup: the ult's destination is exactly where the enemy wants to kite you from, and a Flicker onto the stunned target closes the last stretch before their team arrives.\"]}]]]}]]}]\n"])</script></body></html>